          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "வாதிடு (vātiṭu) is a compound: vātam, \"argument\", is borrowed from Sanskrit vāda, \"speech\" (CDIAL 11507), and native iṭu, \"to put\" (DEDR 442), makes it a verb, as in முத்தமிடு."
            }
